{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\ud83e\udd18</i><strong>Rock' n\u2019 Roll never dies, Crabby never cries! /(\u3112 \u3112)/  \u2261(.\u00a0 .#!)\u2261!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crab Rhapsody is a stylish, unique action roguelike where unique gameplay meets original interactive music! Backed by [Claw House], the Abysea live house tech giant. Music fan Crabby sets out to build cute yet powerful crab bands, wielding music weapons and advanced claw-tech to defeat [Close Crab] - the CrabGPT developer trying to monopolize Abysea\u2019s music. Join the fight to save music and hope to the crab world!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/aab31419d613217195f158f3061b2576.avif?t=1755704183\" width=616 height=353 /></span><i> </i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd80 1. Build Cute Crabby Band (</strong>Customized\u00a0Live Music &amp; Unique Abilities)<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your crab musicians from Rock, Jazz, Funk, Traditional Chinese, Orchestral, and Electronic Synth \u2014 Whether it\u2019s Erhu with a DJ or Drums with a Saxophone \u2014 it\u2019s all up to you! Every mix creates a one-of-a-kind real-time soundtrack. From Martial Arts Bands to High-Tech Hackers to Adorable Idol Crabs, discover countless unique bands, each with their own abilities and styles. <strong>Build your band and your playstyle \u2014 all at once!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/6950b14b6055c96c55940c27ebd1c893.poster.avif?t=1755704183\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/6950b14b6055c96c55940c27ebd1c893.webm?t=1755704183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/6950b14b6055c96c55940c27ebd1c893.mp4?t=1755704183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd80 2. Unique Upgradable Music Weapons</strong> (Diverse Mechanics)<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the <strong>Chinese Flute Spear</strong> to the <strong>Trumpet Shotgun</strong>, the <strong>Guitar Chainsaw</strong> to the <strong>Bass Machine Gun</strong>, the <strong>Pellet Drum Taiji</strong> to the <strong>Guzheng Wind Blade</strong>, and beyond \u2014 the tech giant <i>Claw House</i> arms players with a vast arsenal of powerful, one-of-a-kind music weapons, all delivered straight to you through the <strong>Delivery Drop</strong> service.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/e4587c10d7132f2b749c85140d0d1b1e.poster.avif?t=1755704183\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/e4587c10d7132f2b749c85140d0d1b1e.webm?t=1755704183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/e4587c10d7132f2b749c85140d0d1b1e.mp4?t=1755704183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd80 3. Upgrade and Customize With Claw Chips\u00a0</strong>(Integrated Power-Ups)<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the <strong>Claw Watch</strong>, players can access the <strong>Claw Chip Store</strong> anytime to purchase unique chips and gain new abilities. With versatile Claw Chips, every run can adapt to your preferred playstyle \u2014 whether strategic or action-packed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/84e1ee53088725ab5e2fe7d0b8eeac57.poster.avif?t=1755704183\" width=780 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/84e1ee53088725ab5e2fe7d0b8eeac57.webm?t=1755704183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/extras/84e1ee53088725ab5e2fe7d0b8eeac57.mp4?t=1755704183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2402540?t=1755704183","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2402540?t=1755704183","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/73b15a8bcf8d5b459316a8eb098d016161cf53d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755704183","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402540/73b15a8bcf8d5b459316a8eb098d016161cf53d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755704183","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\ud83e\udd18</i><strong>Rock' n\u2019 Roll never dies, Crabby never cries! /(\u3112 \u3112)/  \u2261(.\u00a0 .#!)\u2261!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Crab Rhapsody is a stylish, unique action roguelike where unique gameplay meets original interactive music! Backed by [Claw House], the Abysea live house tech giant. Music fan Crabby sets out to build cute yet powerful crab bands, wielding music weapons and advanced claw-tech to defeat [Close Crab] - the CrabGPT developer trying to monopolize Abysea\u2019s music. Join the fight to save music and hope to t